empotency evidence is included when the operation mutates durable state; no unsupported capability is advertised.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### TASK-260830-21gygk_primary-summary-prefix-clarification.md\n> Pinned bootstrap prefix constraints for future public summary review\n\nPrimary read-only clarification of the partial public-summary bound: pinned SPEC Section5.7 (internal/specdoc/SPEC.md:2277) defines creating as Session Record AND initial lease existing, and Section13.1 step2 (8117) persists initial Lease Record and session.created before process creation. The partial bounds_test.go comment claiming a valid creating session has no owner event is not sufficient evidence that record-only/no-lease projection is a valid public creating state. Distinguish an interrupted persistence prefix from a completed bootstrap prefix; reconcile the accepted projector empty-chain behavior with these exact normative requirements in future scoped review. No accepted CR is invalidated by this note, no replacement state/error invented, and no nullable/placeholder owner or lease fields authorized. Public-summary observation owners and qualified-selector decision remain outstanding; original task scope is unchanged. This is a routing clarification, not tested product repair or acceptance.\n\n\n\n### TASK-260830-21gygk_resume-v060.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_resume-v060.md`\n\n- Byte count: `3266`\n- Content digest: `sha256:9bf56cdfdea9340a24a9b8e0ddc69b9772f799f86f29fa469b1433e7c9194045`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260830-21gygk_reviewer-v060.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_reviewer-v060.md`\n\n- Byte count: `3155`\n- Content digest: `sha256:d735f00276e7d5753b3ef10553acbcf12f75792f1282773d3062b4f29a5d7921`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260830-21gygk_resume-pr202.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_resume-pr202.md`\n\n- Byte count: `2263`\n- Content digest: `sha256:d4ce8acb26093ecaa9bac0f40dd251c4f867e28b09dd8a185bf2fa20e0fa8c5e`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n### TASK-260830-21gygk_resume-bound-replay.md\nAttached file: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_resume-bound-replay.md`\n\n- Byte count: `3175`\n- Content digest: `sha256:0b52215f5b63938fe52e20c2234576da09a0b86b0e3b6139abed7e524aa787ac`\n- Access: read-only\n\n\n\n\n\n## Evidence and Safety\n\n- Add/update a task-scoped outcome named `TASK-260830-21gygk_*` before handoff:\n  `task-board m 'add_resource(TASK-260830-21gygk, name=TASK-260830-21gygk_results.md, content=\"...\", type=outcome, description=\"Handoff evidence\")'`\n- Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior ships with negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject; prove the bound by narrowing it, not only by deleting it, and name the production call site. Shapes and incidents: `references/negative-evidence.md`.\n- An absence and a failure to read are different facts; report unknown instead of inferring a property from a proxy signal.\n- Stop-The-Line only for an evidence-backed external blocker or unresolved human-only product/platform/architecture/approval decision. Persist evidence, failed attempts, options/tradeoffs, recommendation, and exact input needed; otherwise rework autonomously.\n- `to-review` is a role handoff, not accepted completion. Report **ready for review** or **handed off to review**.\n\n## LAST — Run For Role Handoff\n\nAfter AC, checklist, validation, and outcome evidence:\n\n```bash\ntask-board handoff TASK-260830-21gygk --role developer\n```\n\n## Working Directory\nBoard directory: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board`\n\nWork in the project root. Never edit board files directly.\n\n## Story Workspace\n\nYou are running in an isolated Git worktree for STORY-260830-3tq4ns.\n\n- Workspace path: `.temp/STORY-260830-3tq4ns/worktree` (this is your working directory)\n- Branch: `task-board/story/STORY-260830-3tq4ns`, forked from `main`\n- Authoritative board: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board` (already exported as `TASK_BOARD_DIR`)\n\nMake every repository change here. Do not commit, switch, rebase, merge, or delete this branch, and do not run `task-board` against the `.task-board` copy inside this worktree — it is a checkout artifact, not the board. Integration into trunk is the orchestrator's step, not yours.\n\nLeave your work UNCOMMITTED in the worktree — the handoff snapshots the working tree against the recorded checkpoint. A commit of your own on this branch is refused at handoff with `change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint`, and the repair is `git reset --soft <checkpoint_oid>` before completing again.\n"}}
